# The web app needs NO server-side secrets.
#
# The live demo uses a "bring-your-own-key" model: each visitor pastes their
# own Anthropic API key in the browser, and the browser calls the Anthropic
# API directly. The key never touches this server, and there is no shared key
# to fund or rate-limit. This file exists only to document that there is
# intentionally nothing to configure.
